    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.出亚诺曼城东门至德威特岛（262.281）处，调查木箱获得【螺丝起子】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "3.调查（261.278）处破屋的门，交出【螺丝起子】进入沧桑的豪宅。",
      "type": "item-gated-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆沧桑的豪宅为固定地图，魔物：Lv.20~24使魔、小石像怪，数量：2~4",
