      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "4.至（32.31）处，往西走一步至（31.31）处传送到房间（精准坐标，请勿走歪）。调查宝箱（79.12）获得【SE徽章】。",
      "type": "precision-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "5.调查井（43.19）进入井底，通过黄色传送石（98.76）进入绝望古井。",
